 "Computing the first derivative, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={(4\\sqrt{x}+5{x}^{2}+x)}^{′} \\\\  & ={(4{x}^{1/2}+5{x}^{2}+x)}^{′} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 4{x}^{-1/2}+2\\cdot 5x+1 \\\\  & =2{x}^{-1/2}+10x+1\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x) & ={(2{x}^{-1/2}+10x+1)}^{′} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2{x}^{-3/2}+10+0 \\\\  & =-{x}^{-3/2}+10 \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{x}^{3}}}+10.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-10883/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "89f65f58-bd3d-5c3f-b9e0-462d74d75b59"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-10883"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-10892/selection/e326a281f601aec64d5dcce4921033c5f93cbf7f8b0a7a5809a9962dfadde666" :answer/id #uuid "1f6b4f29-8791-534f-9d1c-da01ac026d49" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "18" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10892/selection/f4f7e304b38327904d9fdebbac3479cccadb547b1c29d7b8e5938e7012f9d65b" :answer/id #uuid "619c1bd2-c3e1-5cd8-9a9c-285ecf1ef538" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-21" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10892/selection/801bcdd9cb6a10cec998162e05f71050c8aaf0c6974f095bdcaef715a09f4aee" :answer/id #uuid "9a044331-b5ff-513d-a64f-ebfaea1ae8f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "21" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10892/selection/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c" :answer/id #uuid "1f4808c8-a4bb-5bbd-91d8-15f73ab306a8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10892/selection/4644593a6ae896793c595e8a37cd468ba91be6a8038e715c4c88cddad1968793" :answer/id #uuid "c40357b2-da5e-56c5-9428-c87c9a970945" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10892/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a31a1465-68c2-5dc5-8f76-ad8c60dd84c0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-10892/selection/4644593a6ae896793c595e8a37cd468ba91be6a8038e715c4c88cddad1968793" :answer-field/choices ["q-10892/selection/e326a281f601aec64d5dcce4921033c5f93cbf7f8b0a7a5809a9962dfadde666" "q-10892/selection/f4f7e304b38327904d9fdebbac3479cccadb547b1c29d7b8e5938e7012f9d65b" "q-10892/selection/801bcdd9cb6a10cec998162e05f71050c8aaf0c6974f095bdcaef715a09f4aee" "q-10892/selection/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c" "q-10892/selection/4644593a6ae896793c595e8a37cd468ba91be6a8038e715c4c88cddad1968793"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-10892" :question/id #uuid "f7d53911-e22c-50ee-9d76-06a1ee070f97" :question/math-academy-id "q-10892" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Find ${f}^{″}(-2)$ if $f(x)=2{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}-7.$" :question/worked-solution "Computing the first derivative, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={(2{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}-7)}^{′} &  \\\\  & =3\\cdot 2{x}^{2}+2\\cdot 4x-0 \\\\  & =6{x}^{2}+8x\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x) & ={(6{x}^{2}+8x)}^{′} \\\\  & =2\\cdot 6x+8 \\\\  & =12x+8\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, evaluating the second derivative at $x=-2$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(-2) & =12(-2)+8 \\\\  & =-24+8 \\\\  & =-16.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-10892/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "89f65f58-bd3d-5c3f-b9e0-462d74d75b59"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-10892"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-10903"] :question/worked-solution "Computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5{x}^{4}+4{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =4\\cdot 5{x}^{3}+2\\cdot 4x \\\\  & =20{x}^{3}+8x\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(20{x}^{3}+8x) \\\\  & =3\\cdot 20{x}^{2}+8 \\\\  & =60{x}^{2}+8.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-104191/selection/ad3806fc3cade9b8dec09fe515a7733daaabbaf202b7fc02d4753328134f6f3d" :answer/id #uuid "852caae1-5fa1-571f-bed1-5f33329f1373" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2{x}^{4}}+\\frac{1}{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104191/selection/0039d8621ca7f77f5d7ed969d3811a9498a345ae82e616a22201b4c67ff31871" :answer/id #uuid "f0fc0225-3148-53f2-bae4-62d9b9c78857" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}-\\frac{1}{{x}^{4}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104191/selection/d10a1ff72f50c3a81e3d121f19b742355ea0154e13b6d60fe953c043f9fb0148" :answer/id #uuid "216681df-7b18-5a5e-8da1-488e2cb7fe70" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}-\\frac{1}{2{x}^{4}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104191/selection/d3cca20720174ed8c6cad0a938d35c5ea9ebb65938f00ec015e3fb433357f621" :answer/id #uuid "c527c1a7-7b0c-5f8c-b01b-0d4afcbdfc1d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3{x}^{3}}-\\frac{2}{x}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104191/selection/11e08c2c4180b2e824d1b69fb6fa15d7866216088998f66db508781145e6f658" :answer/id #uuid "bfd8b1df-cb57-5b27-846d-b7b2f05b7806" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{{x}^{4}}-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104191/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "32a5db2b-2744-535d-bca9-60f41d0e6c1c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-104191/selection/11e08c2c4180b2e824d1b69fb6fa15d7866216088998f66db508781145e6f658" :answer-field/choices ["q-104191/selection/ad3806fc3cade9b8dec09fe515a7733daaabbaf202b7fc02d4753328134f6f3d" "q-104191/selection/0039d8621ca7f77f5d7ed969d3811a9498a345ae82e616a22201b4c67ff31871" "q-104191/selection/d10a1ff72f50c3a81e3d121f19b742355ea0154e13b6d60fe953c043f9fb0148" "q-104191/selection/d3cca20720174ed8c6cad0a938d35c5ea9ebb65938f00ec015e3fb433357f621" "q-104191/selection/11e08c2c4180b2e824d1b69fb6fa15d7866216088998f66db508781145e6f658"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-104191" :question/id #uuid "9a5035fe-0639-5869-866e-1f7ac70119d9" :question/math-academy-id "q-104191" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}$ for $y=ln⁡x+\\frac{1}{6{x}^{2}}.$" :question/worked-solution "Computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(ln⁡x+\\frac{1}{6{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(ln⁡x+\\frac{1}{6}{x}^{-2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{6}\\cdot (-2){x}^{-2-1} \\\\  & ={x}^{-1}-\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{-3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{-1}-\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{-3}) \\\\  & =(-1){x}^{-1-1}-\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot (-3){x}^{-3-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{x}^{4}}-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-104191/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6afb4058-908a-5983-9c1e-78ee3fbadf44"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-104191"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-104192/selection/2b64299b6fc78bf03637b97780b85f47d99d5e4c47c547e40a8b029f83ed88c9" :answer/id #uuid "25d730ce-6aaa-5ad4-995b-53120e4b8cbe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\sqrt{{x}^{5}}-2cos⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104192/selection/c76fdad8b72ff12818ffa1dd4456ad27a4632c53ca247b83a250a17c4d83ea7a" :answer/id #uuid "2df03b6e-2dc8-518a-8f7d-2e7055aaee3b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{{x}^{5}}}-2sin⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104192/selection/49fa7cc84fbef23042f8f49f13509630af362aea00a16c4b95ffcf4a4ebd081c" :answer/id #uuid "4cd6e750-33b6-5b43-a57f-45206a822ab3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sqrt{{x}^{5}}-sin⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104192/selection/27c39f2ef051ee8b29b742a727df18297ef55a01c7d47ec17cd426597d86e577" :answer/id #uuid "03cb8d3f-a34a-52f7-be5d-6543a24c1212" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{{x}^{5}}}+cos⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104192/selection/9536186508ba312b0f84530e53e5ee676572e20f45cb1a75a7eb9f7dec83bc58" :answer/id #uuid "6f4a9bd0-3447-5c93-9307-ef6ab4a221d1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3\\sqrt{{x}^{5}}}+2sin⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104192/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6a49fb81-bbb4-5f7c-8a0c-407153c0252f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-104192/selection/c76fdad8b72ff12818ffa1dd4456ad27a4632c53ca247b83a250a17c4d83ea7a" :answer-field/choices ["q-104192/selection/2b64299b6fc78bf03637b97780b85f47d99d5e4c47c547e40a8b029f83ed88c9" "q-104192/selection/c76fdad8b72ff12818ffa1dd4456ad27a4632c53ca247b83a250a17c4d83ea7a" "q-104192/selection/49fa7cc84fbef23042f8f49f13509630af362aea00a16c4b95ffcf4a4ebd081c" "q-104192/selection/27c39f2ef051ee8b29b742a727df18297ef55a01c7d47ec17cd426597d86e577" "q-104192/selection/9536186508ba312b0f84530e53e5ee676572e20f45cb1a75a7eb9f7dec83bc58"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-104192" :question/id #uuid "e0bfdda6-c7ad-5a9e-b68f-6ae0e04aa7b0" :question/math-academy-id "q-104192" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}$ for $y=\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{x}}+2sin⁡x.$" :question/worked-solution "Computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{x}}+2sin⁡x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4{x}^{-1/2}+2sin⁡x) \\\\  & =4(-\\frac{1}{2}){x}^{-1/2-1}+2cos⁡x \\\\  & =-2{x}^{-3/2}+2cos⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-2{x}^{-3/2}+2cos⁡x) \\\\  & =-2(-\\frac{3}{2}){x}^{-3/2-1}-2sin⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{{x}^{5}}}-2sin⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-104192/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6afb4058-908a-5983-9c1e-78ee3fbadf44"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-104192"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-342877/field-1/ed63d4b38bfe4ba1f4fe91cb0fa075c17285d28bf95553a78e4e0f78108a3dc8" :answer/id #uuid "fa0199b9-8144-5c89-a178-de5cedf0971b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6-8x^{-3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342877/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "dcd7d2df-ba0e-51af-9f41-bdfc00719585" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-342877/field-1/ed63d4b38bfe4ba1f4fe91cb0fa075c17285d28bf95553a78e4e0f78108a3dc8" :answer-field/choices ["q-342877/field-1/ed63d4b38bfe4ba1f4fe91cb0fa075c17285d28bf95553a78e4e0f78108a3dc8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-342877" :question/id #uuid "b685d3a8-eab1-551d-a03b-58f7aef8f487" :question/math-academy-id "q-342877" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}$ for $y=\\frac{6{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}-8}{2x}.$\n\n$\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=$ \n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{6{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}-8}{2x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3{x}^{2}+x-4{x}^{-1}) \\\\  & =6x+1+(-1)(-4{x}^{-2}) \\\\  & =6x+1+4{x}^{-2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6x+1+4{x}^{-2}) \\\\  & =6+0+(-2)(4{x}^{-3}) \\\\  & =6-\\frac{8}{{x}^{3}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-342877/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6afb4058-908a-5983-9c1e-78ee3fbadf44"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-342877"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-10884/selection/2d31d9204569f72ea0c9e92a406f5021a1774c94582370df7d2d57e961daa127" :answer/id #uuid "83b5c389-6322-5277-b0e9-c83db03edfbc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "60{x}^{3}+48x-20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10884/selection/618bdad477d2b9b57deddb05ba463a90a50a7b70a0ec2fe4461418ec890c65cf" :answer/id #uuid "fe9e79e9-0c5e-5884-aed5-1b7c442fa3ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "60{x}^{3}+24x-22" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10884/selection/f09f3074f41d615d66781246686dcbb928c66ad4b352833cac1d6d9037cfdc78" :answer/id #uuid "a3bdd116-956e-5363-bc41-a607d629264a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "60{x}^{3}+24x-20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10884/selection/89e8243ab2808069fb6b984f0b9cf417c464305b7a44f96050b699d7d8be1c1e" :answer/id #uuid "2c3f0363-7636-5707-b4b4-c32bfce441d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "60{x}^{3}-24x-20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10884/selection/0628217884d26d3ec5cbab43ba93fee0f66d8e8ffe73ca9a3cac360e5ddaade2" :answer/id #uuid "af0ec77a-bca4-5677-bbb4-3808634f61b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "30{x}^{3}+24x-20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10884/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "3ee4c3f3-dcb0-5251-a475-8e2e06b41c4f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-10884/selection/f09f3074f41d615d66781246686dcbb928c66ad4b352833cac1d6d9037cfdc78" :answer-field/choices ["q-10884/selection/2d31d9204569f72ea0c9e92a406f5021a1774c94582370df7d2d57e961daa127" "q-10884/selection/618bdad477d2b9b57deddb05ba463a90a50a7b70a0ec2fe4461418ec890c65cf" "q-10884/selection/f09f3074f41d615d66781246686dcbb928c66ad4b352833cac1d6d9037cfdc78" "q-10884/selection/89e8243ab2808069fb6b984f0b9cf417c464305b7a44f96050b699d7d8be1c1e" "q-10884/selection/0628217884d26d3ec5cbab43ba93fee0f66d8e8ffe73ca9a3cac360e5ddaade2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-10884" :question/id #uuid "c9616344-ca96-5e7c-a4c8-e4600a490221" :question/math-academy-id "q-10884" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}$ for $y=3{x}^{5}+4{x}^{3}-10{x}^{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "Computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3{x}^{5}+4{x}^{3}-10{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =5\\cdot 3{x}^{4}+3\\cdot 4{x}^{2}-2\\cdot 10x \\\\  & =15{x}^{4}+12{x}^{2}-20x\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(15{x}^{4}+12{x}^{2}-20x) \\\\  & =15\\cdot 4{x}^{3}+2\\cdot 12x-20 \\\\  & =60{x}^{3}+24x-20.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-10884/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6afb4058-908a-5983-9c1e-78ee3fbadf44"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-10884"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-343114/field-1/b1bb5141cd4730a9a1041154d3f7fa3b48dd851976d53e1bea4afbe2be9d05af" :answer/id #uuid "d8561762-eb0e-5d03-b2d8-9f218eca293b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4x^{-3}+24x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343114/field-1/209fb42baeea118ce0d4a356ba171fc158cf43372544dce055af278a09e3ca38" :answer/id #uuid "0b772a37-e8b0-5a6e-961d-27948ec23264" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4x^{-3}+24x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343114/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "b4720fdb-7da3-5e1b-bfd6-d997cd609cd5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-343114/field-1/b1bb5141cd4730a9a1041154d3f7fa3b48dd851976d53e1bea4afbe2be9d05af" :answer-field/choices ["q-343114/field-1/b1bb5141cd4730a9a1041154d3f7fa3b48dd851976d53e1bea4afbe2be9d05af" "q-343114/field-1/209fb42baeea118ce0d4a356ba171fc158cf43372544dce055af278a09e3ca38"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-343114" :question/id #uuid "7891f6b5-04df-57d0-aa50-3e1688cc9d59" :question/math-academy-id "q-343114" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Given $f(x)=2ln⁡x+{x}^{4},$ we have\n\n${f}^{‴}(x)=$ \n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2ln⁡x+{x}^{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{x}+4{x}^{3} \\\\  & =2{x}^{-1}+4{x}^{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{x}^{-1}+4{x}^{3}) \\\\  & =-2{x}^{-2}+12{x}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, computing the third derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{‴}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-2{x}^{-2}+12{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =4{x}^{-3}+24x \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{{x}^{3}}+24x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-343114/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "322168bb-52e3-5352-a2e3-c5bdbf2bc13e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-343114"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-28546"] :question/worked-solution "First, notice that we can rewrite the function as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}h(x) & =3{x}^{2}-5x+\\frac{3}{x} \\\\  & =3{x}^{2}-5x+3{x}^{-1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{h}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3{x}^{2}-5x+3{x}^{-1}) \\\\  & =6x-5-3{x}^{-2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{h}^{″}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6x-5-3{x}^{-2}) \\\\  & =6+6{x}^{-3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, computing the third derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{h}^{‴}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6+6{x}^{-3}) \\\\  & =-18{x}^{-4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{18}{{x}^{4}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-343120/field-1/65918b307662bf0fe0cd074d71cf640b19381b489c4bd4cd5f41af37a15a9955" :answer/id #uuid "90aa6bcf-291a-53f4-9bc3-7e22a1cd4f06" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sin(x)-e^x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343120/field-1/4d97c066340fa72461e0ed1c6768e59487fac7af0686486675f9df60fd8d49e1" :answer/id #uuid "cbb1dcd8-1924-5ce0-82d7-1f6bc0ea771f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sin(x)+e^x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343120/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "0fb27c2f-a019-539a-ab72-a8ed081a927e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-343120/field-1/65918b307662bf0fe0cd074d71cf640b19381b489c4bd4cd5f41af37a15a9955" :answer-field/choices ["q-343120/field-1/65918b307662bf0fe0cd074d71cf640b19381b489c4bd4cd5f41af37a15a9955" "q-343120/field-1/4d97c066340fa72461e0ed1c6768e59487fac7af0686486675f9df60fd8d49e1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-343120" :question/id #uuid "b4d6e47e-90c0-5c0e-a6ae-7bd34acadde5" :question/math-academy-id "q-343120" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Find ${g}^{(4)}(x)$ for $g(x)=sin⁡x-{e}^{x}.$\n\n${g}^{(4)}(x)=$ \n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(sin⁡x-{e}^{x}) \\\\  & =cos⁡x-{e}^{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{″}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(cos⁡x-{e}^{x}) \\\\  & =-sin⁡x-{e}^{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the third derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{‴}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-sin⁡x-{e}^{x}) \\\\  & =-cos⁡x-{e}^{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, computing the fourth derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{(4)}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-cos⁡x-{e}^{x}) \\\\  & =sin⁡x-{e}^{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-343120/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "322168bb-52e3-5352-a2e3-c5bdbf2bc13e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-343120"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-343086/field-1/720a672cc4dcaa044a20538c7602bfbc378b0f8d69842b502ec8659f2d2f650a" :answer/id #uuid "94d696fe-4b2d-55cf-9ff1-99055f24ebe2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}-\\frac{3}{2}x^{-4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343086/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "b1f49f14-a171-531c-b121-6fb15a980a34" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-343086/field-1/720a672cc4dcaa044a20538c7602bfbc378b0f8d69842b502ec8659f2d2f650a" :answer-field/choices ["q-343086/field-1/720a672cc4dcaa044a20538c7602bfbc378b0f8d69842b502ec8659f2d2f650a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-343086" :question/id #uuid "78e7de72-357a-5c97-92cd-d27b4d4dfb54" :question/math-academy-id "q-343086" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Given $f(x)=\\frac{{x}^{5}-{x}^{2}+x}{4{x}^{2}},$ we have\n\n${f}^{‴}(x)=$ \n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "First, notice that we can rewrite the function as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =\\frac{{x}^{5}-{x}^{2}+x}{4{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{3}}{4}-\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{4x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{{x}^{3}}{4}-\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{4x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{{x}^{3}}{4}-\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{4}{x}^{-1}) \\\\  & =\\frac{3{x}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{1}{4}{x}^{-2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{3{x}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{1}{4}{x}^{-2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{3x}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{-3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, computing the third derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{‴}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{3x}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{-3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}-\\frac{3}{2}{x}^{-4} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}-\\frac{3}{2{x}^{4}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-343086/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "322168bb-52e3-5352-a2e3-c5bdbf2bc13e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-343086"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-343075/field-1/ba246c14cc92d6af0532cc9b57da927ca2b29c4603707bc6e9c6f4b5dd29f537" :answer/id #uuid "ed41d023-2a82-552f-b332-6d20dbb20ad7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "120x^2-18" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343075/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "8b905a51-b17c-5ed0-9b38-fc78eb0b0847" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-343075/field-1/ba246c14cc92d6af0532cc9b57da927ca2b29c4603707bc6e9c6f4b5dd29f537" :answer-field/choices ["q-343075/field-1/ba246c14cc92d6af0532cc9b57da927ca2b29c4603707bc6e9c6f4b5dd29f537"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-343075" :question/id #uuid "6706cc48-5043-57c9-8414-fca036ac3a21" :question/math-academy-id "q-343075" :question/is-example false :question/problem "Given $g(x)=2{x}^{5}-3{x}^{3},$ we have\n\n${g}^{‴}(x)=$ \n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{x}^{5}-3{x}^{3}) \\\\  & =10{x}^{4}-9{x}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{″}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(10{x}^{4}-9{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =40{x}^{3}-18x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, computing the third derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{‴}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(40{x}^{3}-18x) \\\\  & =120{x}^{2}-18.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-343075/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "322168bb-52e3-5352-a2e3-c5bdbf2bc13e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-343075"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
